{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/(tools)/layout,_N_T_/(tools)/tools/layout,_N_T_/(tools)/tools/image-to-pdf/layout,_N_T_/(tools)/tools/image-to-pdf/page,_N_T_/tools/image-to-pdf"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"hi\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/a082d47af8c37992.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-fe1bb94b21fde89c.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-123aadff3a6f1f43.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5030-dfb188e0fb5d9176.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-9edc01f96f8414ff.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2f0b94e8-e8df2f74a73a2e84.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/164f4fb6-ee897d1130b4c734.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/8758-f27bc4e4cee56314.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/(tools)/tools/image-to-pdf/page-751a2811e6845527.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5878-ab61975c236bb910.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2972-f2e7899c8cf0f9e3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4a8f5ea9fb7efe7b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/(tools)/tools/page-578f067a7ab87dcf.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Image to PDF Converter for Govt Jobs | CGSSB</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Convert your JPG/PNG marksheets and documents to PDF format directly in your browser. 100% free and secure tool for CGSSB and CGPSC forms.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.jpg\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><header style=\"background-color:var(--bg-body);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;height:70px\"><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary);letter-spacing:-0.5px\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"CGSSB Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent;border-radius:6px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/>CGSSB</a><nav class=\"desktop-only\" style=\"gap:24px\"><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/jobs\">Jobs</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/current-affairs\">Current Affairs</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/cg-gk\">CG GK</a><a style=\"font-weight:500;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></nav><button class=\"mobile-only\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" style=\"background:none;border:none;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:5px;width:30px;height:30px;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);transition:all 0.3s;transform:none\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);opacity:1\"></span><span style=\"display:block;width:25px;height:3px;background-color:var(--text-main);transition:all 0.3s;transform:none\"></span></button></div></header><main style=\"min-height:calc(100vh - 70px - 150px)\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px\"><section style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:15px\">Image to PDF Converter</h1><p style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text-muted);max-width:800px;margin:0 auto\">Many government job portals require you to upload your 10th/12th marksheets and caste certificates in PDF format. Just click a photo of your document and use this tool to securely convert it into a PDF instantly.</p></section><section><div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color)\"><label style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">Upload Image/Document (JPG/PNG)</label><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" style=\"width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px dashed var(--color-primary);border-radius:4px\"/></div><button disabled=\"\" style=\"width:100%;padding:14px;background-color:var(--text-muted);color:white;border:none;border-radius:4px;font-weight:600;font-size:1.1rem;cursor:not-allowed;margin-bottom:20px\">Convert to PDF</button></div></section><section style=\"margin-top:60px;max-width:800px;margin:60px auto 0\"><h2>Is this tool safe for my documents?</h2><p style=\"color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px\"><strong>Yes, absolutely 100% secure!</strong> Unlike other websites that upload your personal marksheets to their servers, our tool processes everything directly inside your browser. Your images never leave your phone or computer.</p><h2>How to convert any Image to PDF?</h2><ul style=\"padding-left:20px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8\"><li>Click a clear photo of your document (marksheet, certificate, ID, etc.).</li><li>Click &quot;Upload Image/Document&quot; and select your photo.</li><li>Click the &quot;Convert to PDF&quot; button.</li><li>Your PDF will be generated instantly and ready for download.</li></ul></section></div></main><footer style=\"background-color:var(--bg-card);border-top:1px solid var(--border-color);padding:40px 0 20px;margin-top:60px\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center\"><h3 style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">Chhattisgarh Career &amp; Education Portal</h3><p style=\"max-width:600px;font-size:0.9rem\">One-stop destination for CGSSB, CGPSC, Vyapam notifications, syllabus, results, and study materials.</p><div style=\"max-width:800px;background-color:#fffbe8;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:20px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#92400e;text-align:left\"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> CGSSB is an independent informational website and is not affiliated with or operated by the Government of Chhattisgarh, CGSSB, CG Vyapam, CGPSC, or any other government department or examination authority. For official information, please verify details from the relevant official website or notification.</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:15px;margin-top:25px;padding-bottom:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);width:100%;max-width:800px\"><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/author/yuvraj-pratap-rajwade\">Author</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/editorial-policy\">Editorial Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/correction-policy\">Correction Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/terms\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a><span style=\"color:var(--border-color)\">|</span><a style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-main)\" href=\"/disclaimer\">Disclaimer</a></div><div style